TWO LAYERS:
  · The CARBON layer is standard reference chemistry (atomic numbers, symbols, weights,
    groups, periods, and well-known properties). These are facts in the public domain;
    no copyrighted dataset is reproduced.
  · The SILICON layer — the 118 Gates, the four states (1:1, 0:1, 0:1, 0:0=1=0), and the
    nature each element falls to by (Z-1) mod 4 — is the ORIGINAL symbolic system of
    David Lee Wise. It is a lens and a lattice, not a claim about physics.

